  "skill_summaries": {
    "ultimate": "summon magic circles that awaken to affect nearby units; all circles awakened extends effects to entire battlefield",
    "skill1": "immobilize the highest cumulative damage dealer and reduce their stats",
    "skill2": "awaken one magic circle at battle start; nearby enemies with stat reductions charge circle energy",
    "skill3": "battle haste grows with awakened circle count",
    "skill4": "awakened circles periodically apply effects to the weakest units",
    "skill5": "all circles awakened extends battlefield coverage; subsequent casts make allies unaffected and boost their damage"
  },
  "play_overview": "[[Velara]] summons magic circles that awaken around the field, extending to full battlefield coverage once every circle is active. She immobilizes the highest cumulative damage dealer and reduces that target's stats, blunting the main damage source early. One circle awakens at battle start, while nearby debuffed enemies charge circle Energy faster. Haste grows with awakened-circle count, and the circles periodically heal and protect weak allies. Full awakening grants allies Unaffected status and boosts their damage, so fast burst and separated formations deny her best scaling.",
  "counter_overview": "[[Velara]] plants circles that awaken into healing, Haste cuts, and eventually battlefield-wide coverage; later casts grant allies Unaffected status and damage. She also immobilizes the top damage dealer. Her allies' debuffs charge nearby circles faster, so pressure [[Velara]] and those providers rather than changing your own damage type. End the setup with [[filter:heal-inhibitor]] like [[Dunlingr]] paired with [[filter:backline-assassin]] like [[Ravion]] or [[Evie]], or race a carry with [[filter:energy-provider]] like [[Thador]] or [[Hugin]]."
}
